!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = antibody targetdescription: Histones are the main constituents of the protein part of chromosomes of eukaryotic cells. They are rich in the amino acids arginine and lysine and have been greatly conserved during evolution.Histone tails undergo numerous posttranslational modifications. This antibodies recognizes histone H3 monomethylated on lysine 4.
